# Quick concept summary

| Concept | Main Question |
|---|---|
| Abstraction | What should users of this class be able to do without knowing its implementation? |
| Encapsulation | What internal state should the class protect? |
| Responsibility | What should this class know or do? |
| Composition | What other objects does this object contain or use? |
| Has-a relationship | Does one object contain or collaborate with another? |
| Is-a relationship | Is one class genuinely a specialized version of another? |
| Cohesion | Do the responsibilities inside this class belong together? |
| Coupling | How dependent is this class on other classes? |
| Instance member | Does this value or behavior belong to one particular object? |
| Static member | Does this value or behavior belong to the class as a whole? |
| Enum | Does this value come from a fixed set of valid possibilities? |
| Package | How should related Java types be organized and named? |
| Invariant | What condition must always remain true for a valid object? |

