## Complexity summary

| Operation | Array / `ArrayList` | Singly Linked List |
|---|---:|---:|
| Access index | `O(1)` | `O(n)` |
| Search | `O(n)` | `O(n)` |
| Insert at front | `O(n)` | `O(1)` |
| Remove at front | `O(n)` | `O(1)` |
| Append | amortized `O(1)` for `ArrayList` | `O(1)` with tail |
| Traverse all elements | `O(n)` | `O(n)` |

